# CinematicAI Studio - Local Docker Compose Configuration
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to .env before running Docker Compose:
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#   bash scripts/generate-secrets.sh --write
#
# This file is for NON-SECRET settings consumed by docker-compose.yml and
# docker-compose.prod.yml. Sensitive values are files under secrets/, which are
# generated by scripts/generate-secrets.sh and ignored by Git.
#
# AI provider keys are Docker secrets, not .env values:
#   secrets/mistral_api_key and/or secrets/kimi_api_key
#
# For a backend running directly on the host, use backend/.env.
# For a frontend running directly on the host, use .env.local at the repository
# root with API_BASE_URL and JWT_SECRET. Docker Compose sets the frontend's
# API_BASE_URL internally, so it is not read from this file.
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ─── Redis ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Maximum Redis memory for the local stack (default: 1gb).
# REDIS_MAXMEMORY=1gb

# ─── Production reverse proxy ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Public hostname used by Caddy in docker-compose.prod.yml.
# CADDY_HOST=yourdomain.com

# ─── Production registration controls ─────────────────────────────────────────
# These values are consumed by docker-compose.prod.yml.
# Set DISABLE_REGISTRATION=true and a strong INVITE_CODE unless open signup is
# intentional. The first user registered with invite-only mode is an admin.
# DISABLE_REGISTRATION=true
# INVITE_CODE=change_me_to_a_random_32_char_string

# Public browser origin allowed by the production backend.
# CORS_ORIGINS=https://yourdomain.com

# ─── Production AI cost controls ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Hard caps for the production stack. 0 = unlimited.
# MAX_CONCURRENT_GENERATIONS=2
# MAX_STORIES_PER_DAY=10
# AI_DAILY_SPEND_CAP_USD=10
# AI_MONTHLY_SPEND_CAP_USD=100
# AI_DAILY_TOKEN_BUDGET=100000
# AI_MONTHLY_TOKEN_BUDGET=1000000

# ─── Alerting ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Optional external webhook for Prometheus alerts (Slack, PagerDuty, etc.).
# ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL=https://hooks.slack.com/services/YOUR/WEBHOOK/URL
